\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Lord Jesus, think on me,
\par And purge away my sin;
\par From earthborn passions set me free,
\par And make me pure within.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Lord Jesus, think on me,
\par With care and woe opprest;
\par Let me Thy loving servant be,
\par And taste Thy promised rest.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Lord Jesus, think on me,
\par Amid the battle's strife;
\par In all my pain and misery
\par Be Thou my health and life.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Lord Jesus, think on me,
\par Nor let me go astray;
\par Through darkness and perplexity
\par Point Thou the heavenly way.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Lord Jesus, think on me,
\par When flows the tempest high:
\par When on doth rush the enemy,
\par O Saviour, be Thou nigh.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Lord Jesus, think on me,
\par That, when the flood is past,
\par I may the eternal brightness see,
\par And share Thy joy at last.
\par                                 Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

